  contentsAnswer: Laundry and a sealed water jug for my camping trip.
  weightAnswer: About ten kilos; most of it is water.
  metalAnswer: Plastic bottles and fabric. Very little metal apart from the zip.
  packingAnswer: The jug is strapped down, but water can move inside.
  responseAnswer: A slosh after shaking. It will settle back when the platform is
    level.
  authorReasoning: 'Liquid response is innocent: downhill offset under tilt, level
